## Model
`sklearn.ensemble.HistGradientBoostingRegressor`, `{hyperparams}`, `random_state={seed}`,
no early stopping; exported with skl2onnx (opset 17 / ai.onnx.ml 3). ONNX output equals sklearn
output on the test set (max abs diff {onnx_max_abs_diff:.2e}, tested at atol 1e-6).

